.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt EVENT_SIGNAL 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm event_signal
.Nd signal a user-event doorbell
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn event_signal event value
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm sets the doorbell level and wakes event-queue waiters.  The value is
reserved.  The level is consumed when a level-triggered wait reports it.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EPERM
The handle lacks SIGNAL rights.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
